","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-25T20:47:09Z","updated_at":"2024-10-25T20:47:09Z","body":"We tried an use_legacy_names option called https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/48058.\r\n\r\nWill try to find more details. It's been several years since we had to do that procedure.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2438767408/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2439646873","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98516#issuecomment-2439646873","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98516","id":2439646873,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Rag6Z","user":{"login":"JonqsGames","id":6182189,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxODIxODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6182189?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonqsGames","html_url":"https://github.com/JonqsGames","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonqsGames/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonqsGames/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonqsGames/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonqsGames/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonqsGames/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonqsGames/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonqsGames/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonqsGames/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonqsGames/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-26T16:37:48Z","updated_at":"2024-10-26T16:41:02Z","body":"I added a legacy flag in import settings. \r\nRight now i had to keep the bone architecture for legacy to avoid adding more parameter to the 'SkinTool' class. Maybe the skeleton creation should be moved out of this class for clarity.\r\nI have some issues to make the legacy behavior, i can't find a way to differenciate the case of a new import (should use default value : false) or an existing import file not containing the flag (in this case i want to set the flag to true).\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2439646873/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2439688021","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98516#issuecomment-2439688021","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98516","id":2439688021,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Raq9V","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-26T18:35:39Z","updated_at":"2024-10-26T18:35:39Z","body":">  I have some issues to make the legacy behavior, i can't find a way to differenciate the case of a new import (should use default value : false) or an existing import file not containing the flag (in this case i want to set the flag to true).\r\n\r\n@lyuma Do you remember how the old legacy system worked?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2439688021/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2439719249","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98516#issuecomment-2439719249","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98516","id":2439719249,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RaylR","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-26T19:56:16Z","updated_at":"2024-10-26T19:56:16Z","body":"I suspect this code also runs for FBX, hmm.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2439719249/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2439783693","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98516#issuecomment-2439783693","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98516","id":2439783693,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RbCUN","user":{"login":"lyuma","id":39946030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTQ2MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39946030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma","html_url":"https://github.com/lyuma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-27T00:40:33Z","updated_at":"2024-10-27T00:40:33Z","body":"Okay so the idea here is instead of trying to solve it for every case, it specifically addresses the case of bone attachments which are meshes, since AFAIK it is not possible to create these in Blender.\r\n\r\nBecause it is a very specific fix, it is less likely to break one of the test cases, and with a setting, users can change it if it does.\r\n\r\nBy the way, the option name misspells \"attachments\". Instead of calling it legacy, would a more specific name make sense the option determines if we should create bones for mesh nodes.\r\n\r\n> I suspect this code also runs for FBX\r\n\r\nthat's a good thing I think.\r\n\r\nI'm a bit cautious, but I know meshes inside a skeleton also being bones is a common complaint, and this doesn't change that much code. Clearly the tests need to pass.\r\n\r\n> Do you remember how the old legacy system worked?\r\n\r\ni think the toplevel scene import options always get serialized, so it is possible to have a different default from what is initially set in the .import --- we need to make sure project settings import defaults are respected too","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2439783693/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2439926182","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98516#issuecomment-2439926182","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98516","id":2439926182,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RblGm","user":{"login":"JonqsGames","id":6182189,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxODIxODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6182189?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonqsGames","html_url":"https://github.com/JonqsGames","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonqsGames/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonqsGames/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonqsGames/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonqsGames/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonqsGames/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonqsGames/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonqsGames/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonqsGames/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonqsGames/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-27T09:33:34Z","updated_at":"2024-10-27T12:33:54Z","body":"@lyuma I tried to find a way to have different default value but could'nt get it to work. Right now i think it's not possible to have this kind of legacy flag.\r\n\r\nNot sure if the behavior of having mesh being bones is only linked to Blender.\r\nMy guess was it's a confusion of having SkeletonId in node means it's a bone. But it could also apply to this case : a mesh parented to the skeleton via a bone.\r\nIn this case i think this is more of a fix and justify the legacy flag, because the old way is not the expected behavior.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2439926182/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2442920567","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98516#issuecomment-2442920567","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98516","id":2442920567,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RnAJ3","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_